1 (April) and #8841 (May onward) may be the same ticket. The prefix differs, so I haven't merged them.\n- The other Moss digests (2025-03-10, 2025-07-07, 2025-12-01, 2026-05-03, 2026-08-03) mention Vantorre Group but give no ticket numbers. The 12/1 item is a Mobility amendment.\n- These are only the tickets mentioned in those three sources. I haven't looked at the account ticket files.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
